{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:1","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:2","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:3","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/4.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:4","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/5.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:5","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/6.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:6","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/locales/kr/13010513/7.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010513:1:7","lang":"kr","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"faction_dailies/menus/13010513_1_3.kr.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_13010513:1:3","lang":"kr","texts":{"menu:6056270:1":{"text":"액자 관리에 필요한 재료가 다 떨어졌는데, 이를 어떻게 해야 할지...","source_cn":"日常保养的材料都没了，这可怎么办呢……","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"집사 바츨라프","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222160.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222160","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322216001:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">세레니티 장원</style>의 집사 바츨라프가 도움을 요청했어요. 하지만 제가 직접 가기에는 어려운 상황이에요.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>永寂庄园</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D6A7726172451DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322216002:1":{"text":"바츨라프 집사는 꽤 다급해 보였어요. 아무래도 무슨 일이 있는 건 아닌지 걱정이 되네요. 저 대신 그를 도와주실 수 있나요?","source_cn":"瓦茨拉夫管家看起来好着急，我很担心是不是出了什么不好的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x260C5E1C13F087C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222170.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322217001:0":{"text":"집사님, 어디 계세요! 도와드릴 일이 있는 지 확인하러 왔어요!","source_cn":"管家先生在哪里！我们去看看他有什么需要帮助的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4E9C5F653F7B0E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222180.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322218001:1":{"text":"캐롤라이나 양의 부탁을 받고 오셨나요? 다행이군요! 액자 관리 문제로 골치 아팠거든요.","source_cn":"你们是卡列琳娜小姐邀请来帮忙的？太好了，我正为画框保养...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D41695326198BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322218002:1":{"text":"저는 자작님을 위해서 예술품을 관리하곤 하는데, 관리할 때 쓰는 재료가 없어졌습니다. 이러다가는 액자가 썩게 될 거예요.","source_cn":"我经常会为子爵先生做一些艺术品的日常保养，可是保养画框...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BE1BF361A7C605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322218003:1":{"text":"하지만 저는 여기를 떠날 수가 없으니, 여러분께 부탁을 좀 드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"而我不便离开这里，只好麻烦几位了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95C74292E10A69A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322218004:1":{"text":"관리에는 식물성 오일을 사용합니다. 잊지 마세요. 반드시 천연 식물에서 추출한 것이어야 합니다. 가장 좋은 것은 자연스러운 향이 나는 것이지요. 자작님께서 매우 까다로우시거든요.","source_cn":"保养需要一些植物油脂——记住，一定要从天然的植物中提取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D09E82D283DDAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"집사 바츨라프","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222190.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222190","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322219001:1":{"text":"오일과 향료가 전부 다 준비됐어요. 이제 액자 관리 페인트를 만들 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"这样油脂和香气就都有了，可以调配保养画框的涂料了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2358C16702C5A0A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:3:147:0":{"text":"목제품을 관리에 필요한 페인트로, 점성이 강하지만 기름지지 않으며 과일나무의 은은한 향기가 난다.\n\n<style=\"highlight\">맨가니</style>에서 추출한 기름과 <style=\"highlight\">프로스트 구스베리</style>의 과즙을 3:1 황금 비율로 맞춘다.","source_cn":"保养木制品的绝佳涂料，醇厚而不油腻，散发着果木的淡淡清香。\n\n提炼<style=\"highlight\">灵曼根</style>的油脂，再加入<style=\"highlight\">莹霜醋栗</style>的果汁，三比一的黄金比例。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71941052DB5C781","variant_status":"","male":"목제품을 관리에 필요한 페인트로, 점성이 강하지만 기름지지 않으며 과일나무의 은은한 향기가 난다.\n\n<style=\"highlight\">맨가니</style>에서 추출한 기름과 <style=\"highlight\">프로스트 구스베리</style>의 과즙을 3:1 황금 비율로 맞춘다.","female":"목제품을 관리에 필요한 페인트로, 점성이 강하지만 기름지지 않으며 과일나무의 은은한 향기가 난다.\n\n<style=\"highlight\">맨가니</style>에서 추출한 기름과 <style=\"highlight\">프로스트 구스베리</style>의 과즙을 3:1 황금 비율로 맞춘다.","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"액자 관리 페인트 레시피","document_title_male":"액자 관리 페인트 레시피","document_title_female":"액자 관리 페인트 레시피","document_title_cn":"涂料的配方","document_title_status":"matched"},"narration:7:1320820006:0":{"text":"제조 후...","source_cn":"经过一番调制……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040752681A084A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:9:1320820006:0":{"text":"제조 후...","source_cn":"经过一番调制……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x040752681A084A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222200.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1322220001:0":{"text":"와! 맛있는 냄새가 나요!","source_cn":"哇——闻起来好好吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6BB1D3489496283","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322220002:0":{"text":"치피, 이건 먹는 게 아니야!","source_cn":"满满，这可不是能吃的东西呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35392F233C65EE12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13222210.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322221001:1":{"text":"페인트를 가져 오셨습니까? 감사합니다!","source_cn":"你们把涂料带来了？十分感谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26CDDAC8E302420A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322221002:1":{"text":"음... 이 나무의 향기, 부드러운 오일... 바로 제가 찾던 것입니다!","source_cn":"嗯……这果木的清香，顺滑的油脂，正是我所需要的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B825F826413811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322221003:1":{"text":"이제 이걸로 액자가 부식되는 것을 막을 수 있겠군요. 도와주셔서 다시 한 번 감사드립니다.","source_cn":"这样就可以延缓木框的腐朽了，再次感谢各位的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD00252F41E3910A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"집사 바츨라프","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}}}